invariant: INV-3
file: srv_kex.c
catches: srv_flight_test
reason: the server skips the check on the client's secp256r1 point before it
  answers, so a point off the curve draws a P-256 key pair and a ServerHello
  goes out for a key exchange RFC 9846 section 4.3.8.2 says to refuse.
  test_flight_p256_refusals requires illegal_parameter before any
  ServerHello and before any draw.

--- old
    if (!p256_ecdh_point_valid(ch->p256_share)) {
        return CH_EPROTO;
    }
--- new
    (void)p256_ecdh_point_valid(ch->p256_share);
